.TH "TreeSitter::Fixture" "3cr" "2026-11-03" "treesitter 0.1.0" "treesitter API Reference"
.SH "NAME"
TreeSitter::Fixture \- Grammars bundled for specs (\fB\%require \%"treesitter/fixture"\fR), compiled with \fB\%cc\fR into shared libraries in a temporary directory on first use.
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.nf
\fBrequire "treesitter/fixture"\fR
.sp
\fBmodule TreeSitter::Fixture\fR
.fi
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
.PP
Grammars bundled for specs (\fB\%require \%"treesitter/fixture"\fR), compiled with \fB\%cc\fR into shared libraries in a temporary
directory on first use. Not loaded by \fB\%require \%"treesitter"\fR.
.SH "CONSTANTS"
.TP 4
\fBDIRECTORY = File.join(Dir.tempdir, "treesitter\-fixture\-#{Process.pid}")\fR
Where the compiled libraries go; removed by \fB\%clean\fR.
.SH "CLASS METHODS"
.TP 4
\fBdef self.clean : Nil\fR
Removes the compiled libraries.
.TP 4
\fBdef self.language(name : String) : Language\fR
The bundled grammar \fIname\fR, loaded.
.TP 4
\fBdef self.library(name : String) : String\fR
The shared library of the bundled grammar \fIname\fR (\fB\%"json"\fR), compiled on first use; raises \fB\%Error\fR when \fB\%cc\fR fails.
.SH "DEFINED IN"
src/fixture.cr
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR "TreeSitter" (3cr),
.BR "TreeSitter::Error" (3cr),
.BR "treesitter" (7cr)
